:0}],"history":[{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Breakfast & Brunch, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"OPW8NuOC_9FVFXsaHOO5JA","review_id":"_lzG_LOfBe8VGTmNIuZfEA","date":"2017-04-02T22:14:47","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9375817775726318,"text_excerpt":"This was my second trip to District Donuts, and the first to their new Mid City/Lakeview location. YAY to District Donuts for expanding to Lakeview. I love seeing new businesses pop up, especially popular ones like this. I was excited to try a few more donuts than the ones I tried last time. The cinnamon roll is truly the best I've ever had, a must must order. I also ordered the mocha donut which was just ok - basically chocolate on a regular donut, without much mocha. But I had a very hard time choosing between the 15 or so options, so I'm still excited to go back even though they both didn't blow me away. I also ordered a Vietnamese Iced coffee which was SOOOO good. Very sweet, but diff..."},{"business_id":"OPW8NuOC_9FVFXsaHOO5JA","review_id":"9FEAkF3CCE-nGChmjjZ0kA","date":"2017-11-01T03:45:48","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9347927570343018,"text_excerpt":"This location is very consistent to the other District Donuts. Service is good, and staff is friendly. Went on Halloween so there were Halloween themed donuts, my girlfriend and I decided on the Freddie Krueger. There were others, but we typically share one donut cause there's plenty of other items that we like to grab on our visit. Tried the new fried chicken sandwich, it's very good. Chicken was super crispy. One thing I disagree with was my pork slider, it was a bit heavy on the salt, but everything else was still good. Tried the Nitro Brew here, it was legit but much rather the Vietnamese Iced Coffee."},{"business_id":"OPW8NuOC_9FVFXsaHOO5JA","review_id":"EswlHc5YixgqLtBcRY730Q","date":"2017-11-07T05:02:15","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9337462186813354,"text_excerpt":"so good for a brunch spot, and a really good location. parking can be a hassle, but all you really have to do is park in a side street or in front or across haha. they also have a parking lot but the chances of them having a space open is slim to none. seating is rough: usually the line wraps around the tables, so while you/your group is in line, have someone on the lookout for tables and snatch one up while waiting. then when y'all order someone switch spots so the other person can order. (tip for when it's packed lol) food wise, the cinnamon roll was one of the best cinnamon rolls ever. it was just really gooey and warm and the brûléed sugar was to die for, and it was so good with coffe..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"OPW8NuOC_9FVFXsaHOO5JA","photo_id":"btlGTgKn04XTEUc